# Dxun, Mandalore's tests in the jungle (TSL, 403DXN, 402DXN): out past
# the sentries, Kreia's voice at the young boma (Beast Trick learnt, the
# boma fought), Kumus found on his ridge (Xarga's word, asked how he got
# there, the bomas below him driven off and Kumus let go: DSimpson's
# light way, Bao-Dur's +INF, no reward asked), the permacrete detonator by
# the cache pressed and the bomas it stirs fought (Mandalore's test),
# the cache the charges opened (404DXN: its droid foreman examined and
# bashed, the utility droids fought, its boxes searched),
# Kelborn the scout helped against the Onderon intruders (asked about the
# ship and the corpse, "I am. Let's find them."), the two groups of scouts
# fought and Kelborn told only that they would not talk, the zakkeg slain
# and its ear taken; back in camp the ear for the gate guard and Kumus
# safe for Xarga ("I'm glad I was able to return him safely": LSP), and
# Mandalore told of the detonator (his reward).
# Starts from the camp's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @dxun_tests data/routes/tsl/dxun_tests.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Mandalore" side quests "Find the Missing
# Mandalorian", "Blow the Weapon's Cache", "Help Kelborn Wipe Out the
# Intruders", "Kill the Zakkeg", "Learn Beast Trick"
# (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
# Left: the cache's two keyed boxes (no key exists: SKIPPED.md), Davrel's
# rematch outside camp (dxun_circle, after the battle circle).
#
# ASSUMES:
# - Xarga's missingm and the gate guard's zchallenge taken (dxun_camp),
#   Mandalore's explosivesit started (a_es_start).
# - Bao-Dur in the party for Kumus's thanks (c_con_baodurpm, R13 +INF);
#   with the Handmaiden instead her R19 would be the line.
# - tr_beast_control fires on the way north to Kumus (it stands at 38, 80;
#   Kumus's ridge is at 32, 134); fake_kreia speaks, Kreia being away, and
#   teaches Beast Trick. Its boma (boma_young_bc) is fought after.
# - Kumus is spoken to from below his ridge (he stands 6 m above
#   tr_kumustalk, probe talk_across_height). The party waits east of the
#   ridge's foot: a_kumus_free jumps the Exile to WP_KUMUSFREE_3 (40, 129)
#   and c_con_baodurpm wants Bao-Dur within 10 m of him after it (from
#   the trigger's spot he is 10.5 m off and the line never plays).
# - The zakkeg's remains are searched by its tag; the ear (zakkeg_ear) is
#   in its inventory, the gate guard's R31 asks for it (c_hasitem).
# - Kelborn's second group spawns as he walks to WP_KELBORN_ST
#   (a_kel_wpwalk creates npc_2scout*); tr_secondscouts@1 is the nearer.
exit To_402
module 402dxn
say I feel it.       # Kreia (or her voice) at the boma
say [Beast Control] I'll try.
say Can anything else be done with beasts? # Beast Trick (a_givepower)
to tr_beast_control
talk
fight 20             # the boma that resists
say Are you Kumus? Xarga thought you were dead.
say How can I help?  # (twice: the first offer, then after his story)
say So how did you get up there?
say How can I help?
say I'll go drive off these bomas, then.
to tr_kumustalk
talk
fight 25             # the bomas below the ridge (boma_young_qu)
gone boma_young_qu
to 36.5,130.5        # east of his ridge's foot, the party gathered (Bao-Dur's
gather               # word wants him within 10 m of the Exile, who is jumped
say He's just a veteran, like us. # to WP_KUMUSFREE_3: +INF)
use kumus            # let down, thanked, gone to camp (missingm)
talk
say Press button.    # the cache's detonator (deton2), not Kumus's own
use p_detonator_2
talk
fight 30             # the beasts the blast stirs (WP_ES_SPAWN_*)
equip g_w_*sbr*  # the saber back in hand (a fight's chase took up a gun)
exit To_404          # into the cache the charges opened (404DXN)
module 404dxn
say Examine droid.   # the construction droids' foreman: examined, then
say Bash droid.      # bashed (no Computer way to stop them: DSimpson)
use utildroid_mk2
talk
fight 40             # the utility droids, all hostile (a_make_hostile)
unlock g_tresmilhig007@1 # the cache's boxes: two locked (DC 18), the
use g_tresmilhig007@1 # rest open (the two keyed ones have no key: left)
unlock g_tresmilhig007@2
use g_tresmilhig007@2
unlock g_tresmillow008@1
use g_tresmillow008@1
unlock g_tresmillow008@2
use g_tresmillow008@2
use g_tresmillow006@1
use g_tresmillow006@2
use g_tresmillow006@3
use g_tresmillow006@4
use g_tresmillow006@5
use g_tresmillow006@6
exit To_402DXN
module 402dxn
say Why are you here? I thought all the patrols had been stopped. # Kelborn
say A ship?
say Any sign of a crew?
say Take them out? Why?
say I may be able to help. What's the plan?
say I am. Let's find them.
use kelborn
talk
to tr_firstscouts    # the first scouts (om_sc1)
talk
fight 30
use g_tressklcorp001@2 # the skeletal corpse down the side path
to tr_secondscouts@1 # the staging camp (om_sc2), the beasts with them
talk
fight 30
say I came across two groups of scouts. # Kelborn at WP_KELBORN_ST
say =Nothing you need to know about.
use kelborn
talk
to tr_zakkeg_cv      # the zakkeg's scene (zakcv)
talk
fight 40             # the zakkeg
use zakkeg           # its remains: the ear
use g_tressklcorp004 # the two skeletal corpses behind it
use g_tressklcorp005
exit To_403
module 403dxn
say I defeated a zakkeg. Here is its ear as proof.
use g_gate_guard
talk
say I'm glad I was able to return him safely. # Xarga (LSP)
use xarga
talk
say I set off the permacrete detonator in the jungle. # Mandalore: the
say Is there anything else I can do? # charges, his reward (a_es_reward)
use g_mandalore
talk
save dxun_tests_done
